         "wizards/morgoth/cannibal/room/path10", "north",
         "wizards/morgoth/cannibal/room/path53", "west",
         "wizards/morgoth/cannibal/room/path52", "east",
         "A crossing.",
         "You are on crossing.\n" + 
         "North from here is a king's hut.\n", 1)
